received.body:
You applied for the role “{role}” in the Zrzur Team. People from the team read every application; an answer can take a while.

{terms}

We stored your answers, your account and the role. Only the owner and the review team see them. You can withdraw at any time in {channel}: press “My application”. Your answers are then erased at once. More: {privacy}

accepted.body:
Your application for “{role}” was accepted. You are now a volunteer member of the Zrzur Team, and you have the role in {server}.

{rules}

{terms}

accepted_join.body:
Your application for “{role}” was accepted. You are now a volunteer member of the Zrzur Team. Join {server} to receive the role: it is given to you automatically once you are a member.

{rules}

{terms}

accepted_manual.body:
Your application for “{role}” was accepted. This role is only ever given by the owner of Zrzur in person; he will write to you.

{rules}

{terms}

rejected.body:
Thank you for applying for “{role}” and for the time you took. We are not taking your application further this time.
{reason}

This says nothing about you as a member of Zrzur. You are welcome to apply again after {days} days.
